<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were mostly steady.  Demand moderate on a light to moderate movement. Top $58.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>			     Country			    Plant</p>
<p>US 1-2   230-260 lbs.  56.50-57.50, few 58.00	 57.00-58.50,</p>
<p>US 2-3   230-260 lbs.  51.00-56.50</p>
<p>	   210-230 lbs.  46.50-51.00</p>
<p>Sows:  steady to weak over 600 lbs. Top 48.50</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-450 lbs.  42.00-43.00</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs.  43.00-44.00</p>
<p>	   500-600 lbs.  44.00-48.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs.  48.50</p>
</text>
